# Linux Leptocline — Kali-exclusive tools, pulled from the Kali repo (pinned).
# Every name was verified present in kali-rolling before shipping. These are the
# well-known tools Debian does not package; the Debian-native kit is in
# 50-security. Authorised testing only.

